    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 825320938081898666}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 996388418588083267, guid: 02e8685133026b34e80deb1834c9e30d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<b>Effective Date:</b> 8th October 2025\n<b>Company Name:</b> ProDomino
        Ltd\n<b>Website:</b> www.playprodomino.com\n<b>Registered in:</b> England
        and Wales\n\n<b>1. Introduction</b>\nThis End User Licence Agreement (\u201CAgreement\u201D,
        \u201CEULA\u201D) is a legal agreement between you (\u201CUser\u201D, \u201Cyou\u201D,
        or \u201Cyour\u201D) and <b>ProDomino Ltd</b> (\u201CProDomino\u201D, \u201Cwe\u201D,
        \u201Cus\u201D, or \u201Cour\u201D) governing your access to and use of our
        website, software, services, and related content (collectively, the \u201CPlatform\u201D).\nBy
        creating an account, accessing, or using the Platform, you agree to be bound
        by this Agreement, as well as our <b>Privacy Policy</b> and <b>Terms of Service</b>,
        which are incorporated by reference.\nIf you do not agree, you must not use
        the Platform.\n\n<b>2. Eligibility and Age Requirement</b>\nYou must be at
        least <b>13 years old</b> to use the Platform.\nIf you are under 18, you
        confirm that you have obtained permission from your parent or legal guardian
        to use the Platform, and that they have reviewed and agreed to this Agreement
        on your behalf.\nProDomino does not knowingly collect personal information
        from children under 13. If we learn that we have collected such information,
        we will delete it promptly.\n\n<b>3. Licence Grant</b>\nSubject to your compliance
        with this Agreement, ProDomino grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable,
        revocable licence to:\nAccess and use the Platform for personal, non-commercial
        entertainment purposes only; and\nDownload and install any ProDomino applications
        made available for your device solely to access the Platform.\nAll other
        rights are reserved by ProDomino.\n\n<b>4. User Accounts</b>\nTo access certain
        features, you may be required to create an account. You agree to:\nProvide
        accurate, current, and complete information;\nMaintain the confidentiality
        of your login details;\nAccept full responsibility for all activity under
        your account.\nProDomino reserves the right to suspend or terminate your
        account if you violate this Agreement or engage in fraudulent or disruptive
        behaviour.\n\n<b>5. Acceptable Use</b>\nYou agree not to:\nUse the Platform
        for unlawful or harmful purposes;\nHarass, bully, or abuse other players;\nUse
        cheats, exploits, bots, or unauthorised automation tools;\nCopy, distribute,
        or modify any part of the Platform without permission;\nReverse-engineer
        or attempt to extract source code from the Platform.\nProDomino enforces
        fair play and may monitor gameplay to maintain a positive community experience.\n\n<b>6.
        Ownership and Intellectual Property</b>\nAll software, designs, graphics,
        logos, databases, and content on the Platform are owned or licensed by ProDomino
        Ltd and protected under UK and international copyright, trademark, and intellectual
        property laws.\nThis Agreement grants you only a limited licence to use the
        Platform. No ownership rights are transferred to you.\n\n<b>7. Virtual Items
        and Subscriptions</b>\nThe Platform may include virtual items, tokens, or
        premium memberships (\u201CVirtual Items\u201D).\nYou acknowledge that:\nVirtual
        Items have <b>no real-world monetary value</b>;\nThey are <b>non-transferable</b>
        and <b>non-refundable</b>; and\nProDomino may change or discontinue Virtual
        Items at any time.\nRefunds are only available if required under UK consumer
        law.\n\n<b>8. Termination</b>\nYou may close your account and stop using
        the Platform at any time.\nProDomino may suspend or terminate your access
        immediately if:\nYou breach this Agreement;\nYou act in a way that harms
        other users or the Platform; or\nWe are required to do so by law.\nUpon termination,
        all rights granted to you under this Agreement will end immediately.\n\n<b>9.
        Disclaimer of Warranties</b>\nThe Platform is provided <b>\u201Cas is\u201D
        and \u201Cas available\u201D</b> without any warranty of any kind.\nProDomino
        makes no representations or warranties that:\nThe Platform will be uninterrupted
        or error-free;\nThe content will always be accurate or up-to-date; or\nThe
        Platform will meet your expectations.\n\n<b>10. Limitation of Liability</b>\nTo
        the fullest extent permitted by law, ProDomino Ltd shall not be liable for:\nAny
        indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages; or\nAny loss of
        data, revenue, or profits arising from your use of the Platform.\nIf liability
        cannot be excluded, ProDomino\u2019s total aggregate liability shall not
        exceed the total amount (if any) paid by you to use the Platform in the previous
        twelve (12) months.\n\n<b>11. Privacy and Data Protection</b>\nYour personal
        data will be processed in accordance with our <b>Privacy Policy</b>, which
        complies with the <b>UK GDPR</b> and <b>Data Protection Act 2018</b>.\nBy
        using the Platform, you consent to our collection and processing of your
        data as described in that policy.\n\n<b>12. Third-Party Services</b>\nThe
        Platform may include links to or integrations with third-party websites or
        services.\nProDomino is not responsible for the content, functionality, or
        data practices of those third parties.\nYour use of such services is at your
        own risk and subject to their respective terms.\n\n<b>13. Updates and Modifications</b>\nProDomino
        may modify or update this Agreement at any time.\nChanges will be posted
        on the Platform, and your continued use after such updates constitutes acceptance
        of the revised terms.\n\n<b>14. Governing Law and Jurisdiction</b>\nThis
        Agreement and any related dispute shall be governed by and construed in accordance
        with the laws of <b>England and Wales</b>.\nYou agree that the courts of
        <b>England and Wales</b> shall have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute
        arising from or related to this Agreement.\n\n<b>15. Contact Information</b>\nIf
        you have any questions or concerns about this Agreement, please contact us
        at:\n<b>ProDomino Ltd</b>\nWebsite: www.playprodomino.com\nEmail: info@playprodomino.com\nRegistered
        Office: <b>260 Hospital Street, Birmingham, England, B19 2YF</b>\n\n<b>End
        of Agreement</b>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
